message: "If you use Sanchai, the Nepali Clinical Lexicon, or NepClinBench in your academic research, please cite this work as follows."
title: "Sanchai: A Zero-Hallucination Nepali Clinical Health Ledger & Offline-First Multimodal AI Assistant"
abstract: "A clinically grounded personal health ledger and evaluation pipeline engineered for Nepal's healthcare ecosystem. Features deterministic 3-tier clinical normalization across 300 concepts verified against Nepal DDA, NLEM 2021, and WHO ICD-11, dual-tier Google Gemma 4 AI, and offline-first Segno emergency optical QR triage."
